WEBVTT

00:03.995 --> 00:06.073
Hey! What are you doing, bastard?!

00:08.242 --> 00:11.036
Go! Forget me and protect the demon sword!

00:11.370 --> 00:12.371
Like hell I can!

00:12.788 --> 00:15.958
I have to take you with me,
or it's pointless!

00:16.959 --> 00:18.919
Then... save me.

00:19.628 --> 00:21.713
If your duty is to take me with you,

00:22.172 --> 00:23.465
then protect the demon sword!

00:25.092 --> 00:27.177
Come and save me!

00:31.164 --> 00:32.266
Why did I do this...

00:32.766 --> 00:33.767
It's too reckless.

00:34.768 --> 00:36.478
That's correct.

00:37.146 --> 00:40.566
I know everything about you.

00:40.566 --> 00:42.860
Hope doesn't suit you.

00:44.194 --> 00:47.714
This base and the witch are both mine.

00:47.714 --> 00:50.159
And in time, the demon sword, too.

00:51.368 --> 00:53.203
Up to this point, and from now on...

00:53.512 --> 00:55.222
There is no hope for you.

00:56.207 --> 00:58.500
I've always been alone all this time.

00:59.084 --> 01:00.419
No one will save me.

01:00.919 --> 01:02.171
There is no hope for me.

01:02.713 --> 01:05.464
I... know that.

02:42.187 --> 02:44.606
Hey, so you're Ashgan?

02:48.902 --> 02:53.573
I guess demon swords aren't
as big of a deal as I thought.

02:58.245 --> 03:02.766
(The Witch and the Demon Sword - Act III)

03:05.252 --> 03:09.047
Without Helga,
there is no way to break my seal!

03:09.464 --> 03:10.593
Turn back, now!

03:10.594 --> 03:11.842
Shut up.

03:12.217 --> 03:13.802
No need to order me around.

03:14.094 --> 03:17.055
I'll bring back that witch
with my blood, sweat, and tears.

03:18.307 --> 03:20.767
Where are you going?

03:21.059 --> 03:22.811
How the hell am I gonna fly?

03:23.603 --> 03:25.288
We'll reconvene with Ashaf.

03:25.564 --> 03:26.565
What?

03:26.982 --> 03:29.401
You can't even use a single spell?

03:33.613 --> 03:35.073
The wall is disappearing.

03:43.582 --> 03:44.891
Did they kill each other?

03:47.753 --> 03:50.839
Huh. So you're not dead yet.

03:55.344 --> 03:57.387
Well well, if it isn't Guideau.

03:58.263 --> 04:00.891
Good to see that
you were able to run away.

04:01.808 --> 04:03.602
I'm like this, as you can see.

04:04.394 --> 04:06.188
But I'm fine, I guess.

04:08.899 --> 04:10.359
He saved me.

04:13.403 --> 04:16.298
He's still breathing. I'll treat him now.

04:16.298 --> 04:18.825
Huh? Why should you? Leave him.

04:19.291 --> 04:21.709
Guideau. Did the Executioner show up?

04:22.287 --> 04:23.914
Yeah, he did.

04:24.498 --> 04:27.501
I've convinced him
that Executioners exist.

04:28.043 --> 04:29.669
He'll be of help to us.

04:37.135 --> 04:39.513
Are you letting me live?

04:39.971 --> 04:41.515
Why did you hold back?

04:42.182 --> 04:45.227
A great elemental's power isn't that weak.

04:46.520 --> 04:48.355
There are various forms of magic.

04:49.439 --> 04:52.375
Did my subordinate betray me
out of her own will,

04:52.559 --> 04:54.711
or has she been controlled with magic?

04:55.654 --> 04:57.531
I couldn't determine that.

04:59.032 --> 05:02.077
If I didn't restrain
the great elemental's power,

05:03.036 --> 05:05.163
I would've killed her.

05:05.831 --> 05:07.374
That's not all.

05:07.916 --> 05:12.796
You also went pretty easy
on Guideau right here.

05:13.922 --> 05:16.174
The Man of Ice, Matt Cugat.

05:16.883 --> 05:18.468
You're softer than I thought.

05:19.302 --> 05:21.888
That softness will cost you your life.

05:25.392 --> 05:29.062
The demon sword and girl that
should've been brought to the base...

05:29.688 --> 05:32.065
Is the witch not around?

05:32.732 --> 05:34.376
What happened up there?

05:34.776 --> 05:37.529
Everything has fallen to
the hands of the Executioner.

05:38.029 --> 05:40.198
Your battalion has been
completely wiped out.

05:40.657 --> 05:41.950
How pathetic.

05:43.093 --> 05:44.469
I see.

05:47.222 --> 05:51.017
Now, then.
The Executioner is after the demon sword.

05:51.543 --> 05:55.046
In that case, he'd probably come
running here soon to chase after it.

05:55.505 --> 05:58.133
Meanwhile, over here,
we have one person on the brink of death

05:58.133 --> 06:02.637
and a spellcaster who's spent
his energy on healing him.

06:03.013 --> 06:06.099
I'm not in a condition where
I can cook up something grand.

06:06.808 --> 06:10.604
If that's the case, can you at least
hide the demon sword somewhere?

06:11.104 --> 06:13.104
We can't do that.

06:13.540 --> 06:15.984
That demon sword will enthrall someone.

06:16.151 --> 06:18.695
What? Then don't enthrall anyone.

06:18.904 --> 06:22.908
Unfortunately, it's not something
that happens because I willed it to.

06:23.592 --> 06:25.385
So, in short...

06:26.161 --> 06:29.414
It means fighting back
won't really achieve much.

06:30.373 --> 06:35.045
Huh. I thought you'd be
stealthing around by now.

06:35.545 --> 06:38.548
And I took all of this manpower with me.

06:38.798 --> 06:40.592
This is kind of embarrassing, now.

06:41.218 --> 06:43.053
Mind control...

06:43.595 --> 06:47.140
Is that the power of your
forbidden instrument, Executioner?!

06:47.474 --> 06:49.309
Hm? Oh.

06:49.684 --> 06:52.103
That's precisely the case,
Lieutenant Colonel.

06:52.687 --> 06:57.108
Created by the powerful leader
of a lost ancient nation,

06:57.442 --> 07:01.279
sewn together from the skin of
seventeen ancient kings.

07:01.530 --> 07:03.865
The Demon Hand, Ishlingen.

07:04.741 --> 07:07.802
To add to that, an enchanted royal ring

07:07.802 --> 07:11.355
is put on the right index finger,
the symbol of authority,

07:11.355 --> 07:13.322
enhancing its power.

07:13.667 --> 07:15.835
By caressing someone with this hand,

07:16.127 --> 07:20.423
they all will start obeying my orders.

07:21.967 --> 07:26.263
But witches don't seem to listen to me
no matter how much I touch them.

07:26.555 --> 07:27.806
It's quite the trouble.

07:28.056 --> 07:32.894
I've used too much power, and now
it's about time to offer my payment.

07:35.605 --> 07:36.439
Stop!

07:43.881 --> 07:44.906
Phew.

07:45.282 --> 07:49.661
This is the hassle that comes
with using a forbidden instrument.

07:53.331 --> 07:54.165
Don't let her escape!

07:58.044 --> 08:00.255
You did set something up, after all.

08:02.591 --> 08:05.510
This is just some makeshift solution,
not something I set up!

08:05.927 --> 08:07.887
Take Helga with you and run, Guideau!

08:11.182 --> 08:14.477
I don't know if I can be
the help you expect me to be..

08:17.539 --> 08:20.025
We didn't have to turn back in the end.

08:20.400 --> 08:23.254
Oh? Did you want to come save me?

08:23.254 --> 08:24.821
Stop yapping.

08:25.071 --> 08:26.256
Come on, let's run!

08:26.489 --> 08:27.282
Behind you.

08:27.716 --> 08:28.533
Look out!

08:45.967 --> 08:49.888
No matter how much I touch them,
witches won't listen to me.

08:50.221 --> 08:51.806
I'm sorry.

08:52.432 --> 08:53.892
That was...

08:53.892 --> 08:55.185
...a lie.

08:59.898 --> 09:01.358
I'm sorry, I guess.

09:02.192 --> 09:03.610
Even if you didn't want to do it,

09:04.027 --> 09:06.237
you did save me again and again. But...

09:13.870 --> 09:15.622
I made it all go to waste. Sorry.

09:24.756 --> 09:27.050
You did so well, Helga!

09:27.342 --> 09:28.718
Come here.

09:42.440 --> 09:46.069
It's finally in the hands
of who it should belong to.

09:46.277 --> 09:47.320
Now, then...

09:47.946 --> 09:49.614
Stop! Don't unsheathe it!

09:50.198 --> 09:51.491
Think this over.

09:51.700 --> 09:54.135
If that demon sword's power
is as the legends say,

09:54.135 --> 09:57.038
then why have the witch
been facing danger all this time...

09:57.288 --> 09:59.791
...yet stubbornly not unsheathe it?!

10:00.125 --> 10:04.087
It's because it will create
a more dire situation than this!

10:06.565 --> 10:08.258
So noisy.

10:12.470 --> 10:14.013
Are you surprised?

10:14.431 --> 10:18.518
Nothing will happen out of
just unsheathing a demon sword.

10:19.728 --> 10:22.814
I know everything about demon swords.

10:23.398 --> 10:25.108
For example, these girls.

10:25.692 --> 10:27.932
The Dauntless Witch's clan,

10:27.933 --> 10:30.947
who has been strictly isolating
and protecting the demon sword.

10:31.507 --> 10:35.051
Why is she strolling
around here with it, then?

10:35.535 --> 10:37.762
Of course, I know the reason.

10:38.246 --> 10:42.959
That's because their hideaway
was burned to the ground.

10:44.002 --> 10:46.437
The clan was made to reveal
the secrets of the demon sword,

10:46.437 --> 10:48.089
and they were all killed.

10:48.089 --> 10:50.300
The sole survivor, Helga,

10:50.633 --> 10:54.053
embarked on a journey to run away
and protect the magic sword.

10:54.304 --> 10:56.598
Why do I know this, you ask?

10:57.182 --> 10:58.975
Let me answer that for you.

11:00.226 --> 11:01.452
That's because

11:01.603 --> 11:04.731
us Executioners were behind all of that.

11:05.857 --> 11:06.816
You were...

11:09.027 --> 11:10.211
You were the one who...

11:10.211 --> 11:12.505
Oops, I wavered.

11:12.697 --> 11:15.366
Witches sure have a strong resistance.

11:16.493 --> 11:21.681
Now, lastly, I will tell you the one thing
you all want to know the most.

11:21.681 --> 11:22.415
Stop.

11:22.791 --> 11:24.209
You shall not unsheathe me!

11:27.962 --> 11:31.549
The necessary thing to break the seal...

11:32.383 --> 11:34.427
...is a witch's heart.

11:37.322 --> 11:38.364
Scumbag!

11:38.640 --> 11:41.142
What have we been doing all of this for?!

11:41.451 --> 11:42.869
Don't let her die no matter what!

11:43.645 --> 11:46.523
And now, the seal has been broken!

11:47.065 --> 11:48.900
Demon sword, Ashgan!

11:56.199 --> 11:57.242
Helga.

11:57.784 --> 11:59.661
Helga, you can't.

12:00.328 --> 12:02.205
How many times do I have to tell you?

12:02.997 --> 12:05.542
You have to let the demon sword
rest in slumber underground.

12:05.917 --> 12:06.851
Otherwise, it's dangerous.

12:07.544 --> 12:09.087
You can't take it outside.

12:11.297 --> 12:15.443
Do you know how important
the duty of our clan is?

12:16.261 --> 12:20.348
Only you and I inherit
the powers of a witch.

12:20.682 --> 12:21.975
Get ahold of yourself.

12:22.767 --> 12:23.893
I mean...

12:24.561 --> 12:25.937
I mean, it's because...

12:51.045 --> 12:52.088
What's going on?

13:02.056 --> 13:03.032
Stop!

13:03.032 --> 13:04.642
Mommy! Stop!

13:12.251 --> 13:13.526
What in the world...

13:20.533 --> 13:21.492
Big sis...

13:22.327 --> 13:23.660
You've been hiding here,

13:23.661 --> 13:25.496
so that means you're still
yourself, right, Helga?

13:26.247 --> 13:29.208
You have to sword with you,
so you have to run away all by yourself.

13:30.793 --> 13:32.378
You can't stay here anymore.

13:33.212 --> 13:36.341
Those people...
Mom called them Executioners.

13:37.467 --> 13:40.011
Because of them,
everyone's acting all strange.

13:45.475 --> 13:48.770
Even mom has fallen to their hands.

13:49.938 --> 13:52.982
Listen. Whatever happens,
don't let them have the demon sword.

13:53.691 --> 13:55.610
You have to protect it.
Protect the demon sword.

13:56.736 --> 13:59.280
I'll go and be a decoy for them
or whatever I have to be.

13:59.948 --> 14:02.158
So, please...

14:20.510 --> 14:22.320
This is quite the problem.

14:22.320 --> 14:24.472
She's not speaking at all.

14:25.056 --> 14:30.561
Master taught us to not take away
too much hope or cause too much despair.

14:31.104 --> 14:33.606
That's a difficult thing for me.

14:38.420 --> 14:39.712
Hey, you.

14:40.196 --> 14:42.740
Just let me know this one thing.

14:43.199 --> 14:45.199
Even if you don't say anything,

14:45.451 --> 14:48.788
with my forbidden instrument,
the secrets about the demon sword...

14:49.163 --> 14:52.959
...will all be coughed up
by your mommy, I'm sure.

14:54.210 --> 14:57.922
What's the point of
putting so much effort?

15:09.684 --> 15:10.852
Hey, Helga.

15:12.645 --> 15:15.356
Sealing the demon sword
and protecting the world...

15:16.024 --> 15:19.986
Putting that much effort for the people
outside you've barely ever seen before...

15:20.611 --> 15:22.071
I'm sure you don't get the point of it.

15:22.822 --> 15:25.450
Even so, we all risked our lives for it.

15:27.493 --> 15:29.162
Do not ever throw it all away.

15:35.960 --> 15:37.837
Do you hate those people?

15:39.422 --> 15:42.316
If you seek revenge, unsheathe me.

15:43.092 --> 15:45.236
Yes. I want to seek revenge.

15:46.512 --> 15:48.639
I want to kill all of those people.

15:49.807 --> 15:52.727
But I will never unsheathe you!

15:53.370 --> 15:56.647
Mommy and my big sister
will never want that!

15:57.940 --> 16:01.110
Even if that brings danger upon you?

16:01.402 --> 16:02.737
Even so, I won't unsheathe you.

16:03.821 --> 16:05.990
If you got released,

16:06.591 --> 16:09.160
what kind of terrible thing would happen?

16:18.377 --> 16:19.837
What happened?

16:20.129 --> 16:22.840
Did it... slice that?

16:23.925 --> 16:25.301
Yes, it sliced that.

16:25.468 --> 16:27.720
And not just the town or the base.

16:28.012 --> 16:29.055
The barrier, too!

16:29.722 --> 16:32.058
He didn't decipher the spell or anything.

16:32.809 --> 16:36.104
He tore through the Paladin Corps' barrier
with brute force.

16:36.896 --> 16:38.247
I see, now.

16:38.439 --> 16:40.666
The power that's going
to destroy the world, huh?

16:41.776 --> 16:42.777
Now I understand.

16:44.445 --> 16:45.947
This is the demon sword!

16:46.322 --> 16:48.908
Amazing! What amazing power!

16:49.408 --> 16:53.538
Demon sword!
First, you shall kill Matt Cugat!

16:59.377 --> 17:01.229
- Hm?
- Executioner.

17:01.462 --> 17:03.548
You have misunderstood something.

17:03.923 --> 17:05.923
About the demon sword's true nature.

17:06.134 --> 17:07.836
Misunderstood?

17:08.164 --> 17:11.836
No, I think there's no problem
with my understanding of it.

17:12.682 --> 17:15.768
"Its wielder will have power
that can rule the world,

17:16.642 --> 17:18.521
bringing destruction to everything else."

17:19.248 --> 17:21.816
That's just superstition. I know that.

17:22.733 --> 17:25.903
What the demon sword
grants to its wielder

17:26.358 --> 17:28.281
is the guarantee of their own survival!

17:28.781 --> 17:30.668
The one who unsheathes it

17:30.668 --> 17:33.452
is the only person the demon sword
will not be able to harm.

17:33.828 --> 17:36.914
That's their privilege.
But that's the only thing.

17:37.373 --> 17:39.876
That's the only thing granted to them.

17:40.334 --> 17:41.919
But even so,

17:41.919 --> 17:46.465
I still have this demon hand that can turn
the demon sword into my loyal servant!

17:46.591 --> 17:49.594
This forbidden instrument was
even able to bend the will of a witch

17:49.594 --> 17:53.990
and I've sacrificed over a hundred
of Cugat's subordinates to it!

17:54.849 --> 17:59.395
The witch and the demon sword both indeed
have powers beyond human capabilities.

17:59.770 --> 18:03.691
However, their hearts are
the exception to that!

18:04.275 --> 18:07.778
I said that's where you've misunderstood.

18:13.201 --> 18:15.136
The thing the witch sealed

18:15.536 --> 18:18.331
was its power and its beastly nature.

18:19.207 --> 18:23.419
Even I also know a little bit about
unsealed demon swords.

18:25.671 --> 18:29.383
Taking down so many witches
must have made you arrogant.

18:31.802 --> 18:34.180
Stop!

18:35.181 --> 18:36.741
That forbidden instrument

18:36.742 --> 18:39.352
works by using the respect
and fear people have for its user.

18:39.727 --> 18:43.606
It enhances those feelings to its
maximum limit. That's how it works.

18:44.440 --> 18:47.068
But demon swords originally
don't have any sense of reason.

18:47.526 --> 18:50.905
They only have their bodies
and their impulse for destruction.

18:51.656 --> 18:54.909
Monsters that don't have any sort
of will to respect or fear others.

18:55.260 --> 18:57.411
How can you control that?

18:58.537 --> 19:00.081
This is a demon sword's true nature.

19:00.539 --> 19:04.001
What you unleashed is something
that humans can't ever match up to.

19:04.377 --> 19:05.544
It's a monster.

19:11.509 --> 19:12.802
O great elemental...

19:13.344 --> 19:15.805
I will give you my left arm
if that is what you wish.

19:16.180 --> 19:19.433
Do not let a single person die!

19:22.895 --> 19:24.981
My mind control doesn't work...

19:25.606 --> 19:27.458
No, I'm sure that's not the case.

19:27.458 --> 19:30.878
Sacrifices! Not enough sacrifices!
I'm sure that's the case!

19:35.157 --> 19:36.158
Hey!

19:36.409 --> 19:37.751
What's going on?

19:37.752 --> 19:39.578
Aren't you supposed to be
controlling the demon sword?

19:39.954 --> 19:42.832
Why do you think I've been
working with you all this time?!

19:43.040 --> 19:43.791
Do something alrea...

19:46.377 --> 19:47.853
More.

19:47.853 --> 19:49.630
I need more sacrifices!

19:49.922 --> 19:51.465
Many more!

19:53.759 --> 19:55.932
The demon sword will not harm me.

19:55.932 --> 19:58.030
I can try as many methods as I want.

19:58.472 --> 20:01.267
I'll bring more sacrifices,
and it'll go back to me!

20:02.476 --> 20:03.811
Oh, that's right.

20:04.186 --> 20:07.315
Where did the citizens evacuate, again?

20:08.774 --> 20:11.814
You can go wild as much as you want,

20:11.815 --> 20:14.030
demon sword Ashgan.

20:23.831 --> 20:24.915
Ashgan...

20:25.724 --> 20:26.917
You're awake.

20:28.143 --> 20:29.170
The seal...

20:30.004 --> 20:31.130
Has it been broken?

20:31.881 --> 20:32.798
Yeah.

20:33.357 --> 20:34.759
It's all over now.

20:35.593 --> 20:37.636
Nothing can stop Ashgan.

20:38.596 --> 20:41.390
Hurry... leave me and run.

20:42.099 --> 20:43.809
You shouldn't be around me.

20:48.790 --> 20:51.859
He must hate my clan so much.

20:53.944 --> 20:54.966
In the end,

20:54.967 --> 20:58.674
I guess I'll end up dead without
even fulfilling my duty.

21:01.202 --> 21:02.219
I'm pissed.

21:02.787 --> 21:05.389
At least... at least...

21:06.290 --> 21:08.918
I wanted to at least
know what a kiss feels like!

21:11.605 --> 21:13.214
You haven't had one?

21:13.631 --> 21:15.316
No, I haven't! Got a problem with that?!

21:15.424 --> 21:18.094
Hey, treat my legs, too.

21:18.386 --> 21:20.012
I can't even walk straight.

21:20.471 --> 21:21.263
Guideau.

21:21.806 --> 21:24.283
Seems like all the cards
are on the table now.

21:26.283 --> 21:28.979
We thought it was just
the Paladin Corps at first,

21:29.355 --> 21:31.690
but now there's also a great elemental,
and an Executioner...

21:32.149 --> 21:34.752
...and an unsealed demon sword, as well.

21:38.739 --> 21:41.534
Good grief.
They're all on the table, all right.

21:42.785 --> 21:43.886
Now, then.

21:43.886 --> 21:46.956
Should we also use it?

21:48.767 --> 21:49.517
Helga.

21:49.834 --> 21:54.213
That wish of yours...
will you let us fulfill it?

21:54.964 --> 21:55.965
Huh?

21:55.965 --> 21:57.716
Huh? What?!

21:58.134 --> 22:00.277
Now, close your eyes...

22:00.277 --> 22:02.488
Eek! Wait a minute! Wait just a minute!

22:02.488 --> 22:05.324
You can't! I mean, you can, but...

22:05.324 --> 22:08.869
Wait... You'll fulfill my wish,
so that means...

22:08.869 --> 22:10.871
You can't mean... for real?!

22:12.398 --> 22:14.191
Yes, of course.

22:14.793 --> 22:16.193
That's exactly what I mean.

24:00.464 --> 24:03.050
The power to destroy the world...

24:03.342 --> 24:05.094
There are countless
of those things out there.

24:05.844 --> 24:09.573
(The Witch and the Demon Sword - Epilogue)
Next episode, "The Witch and the Demon Sword - Epilogue"
